{"title":"Career Roadmap · Operations Analyst","role":"Operations Analyst","summary":"An Operations Analyst analyses business processes, operational data, costs, productivity, service levels, and workflows to identify inefficiencies and improve organisational performance.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"BBA – Business Analytics is a strong and direct foundation because it combines business management, operations, statistics, analytics, and decision-making. The student should build a practical technology stack around Excel, SQL, Power BI, statistics, process analysis, and automation."},{"type":"p","text":"The long-term objective should be to progress from reporting and process analysis into business analysis, operations strategy, supply-chain analytics, process improvement, or analytics management."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Typical Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Business & Analytics Foundation"},{"text":"BBA + analytics tools + operations projects + internship"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Operations Analytics"},{"text":"Operations Analyst, Business Analyst, Process Analyst"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Process & Analytics Management"},{"text":"Senior Operations Analyst, Operations Manager, BI/Process Improvement Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Operations Leadership"},{"text":"Operations Strategy Manager, Analytics Head, Business Operations Head"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the BBA Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Business & Quantitative Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of management"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Business mathematics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Organisational behaviour"},{"text":"Marketing fundamentals"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Operations management fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"Basic data visualisation"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"PowerPoint"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Quantitative Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Practise:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Percentages"},{"text":"Ratios"},{"text":"Averages"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Basic forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Operations & Analytics Core"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Operations Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Process design"},{"text":"Process mapping"},{"text":"Capacity planning"},{"text":"Inventory management"},{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Quality management"},{"text":"Supply-chain fundamentals"},{"text":"Service operations"},{"text":"Queueing fundamentals"},{"text":"Cost management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Process Improvement"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bottleneck analysis"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"Pareto analysis"},{"text":"Fishbone analysis"},{"text":"5 Whys"},{"text":"Lean fundamentals"},{"text":"Six Sigma fundamentals"},{"text":"KPI design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — Analytics Skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Target advanced proficiency in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"SUMIFS/COUNTIFS"},{"text":"PivotTables"},{"text":"PivotCharts"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Dynamic arrays"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Basic automation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Date functions"},{"text":"Aggregations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use SQL to answer real operational questions."},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data loading"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"DAX"},{"text":"Measures"},{"text":"KPIs"},{"text":"Drill-downs"},{"text":"Interactive dashboards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Operations Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Start analysing real operational problems."},{"type":"h","text":"Key Metrics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Utilisation"},{"text":"Cycle time"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Throughput"},{"text":"SLA"},{"text":"Turnaround time"},{"text":"Defect rate"},{"text":"Error rate"},{"text":"Cost per transaction"},{"text":"On-time delivery"},{"text":"Inventory turnover"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business Questions"},{"type":"p","text":"An Operations Analyst should be able to answer:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Where is the process slowing down?"},{"text":"Why is productivity declining?"},{"text":"Which process creates the highest cost?"},{"text":"Which location performs best?"},{"text":"Where are customers experiencing delays?"},{"text":"What is causing SLA failures?"},{"text":"What would happen if demand increases by 20%?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year — Advanced Operations Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Move from descriptive reporting into decision support."},{"type":"h","text":"Forecasting"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Time-series fundamentals"},{"text":"Moving averages"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Seasonality"},{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Capacity forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Optimisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Resource allocation"},{"text":"Workforce planning"},{"text":"Inventory optimisation"},{"text":"Cost optimisation"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Capacity utilisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Power Automate where relevant"}]},{"type":"p","text":"to reduce repetitive operational reporting."},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Operations Performance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a Power BI dashboard containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Orders"},{"text":"Processing time"},{"text":"SLA achievement"},{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Errors"},{"text":"Regional performance"},{"text":"Employee/team performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Process Improvement Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Map a business process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Input","Process","Bottleneck","Output"]},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Process steps"},{"text":"Waiting time"},{"text":"Rework"},{"text":"Errors"},{"text":"Bottlenecks"},{"text":"Cost"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then recommend improvements."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Inventory Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stock levels"},{"text":"Reorder points"},{"text":"Safety stock"},{"text":"Inventory turnover"},{"text":"Slow-moving inventory"},{"text":"Stockouts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build an inventory dashboard."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Workforce Productivity Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employees"},{"text":"Work hours"},{"text":"Tasks completed"},{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Overtime"},{"text":"Absenteeism"},{"text":"Cost per employee"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Identify productivity improvement opportunities."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Customer Service Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tickets"},{"text":"Resolution time"},{"text":"First-response time"},{"text":"SLA"},{"text":"Escalations"},{"text":"Customer satisfaction"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Determine the major causes of service delays."},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Project"},{"type":"h","text":"End-to-End Operations Intelligence System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"h","text":"Operational Data"},{"type":"h","text":"SQL Database"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Cleaning"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI Data Model"},{"type":"h","text":"KPI Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Root-Cause Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Forecast"},{"type":"h","text":"Improvement Recommendation"},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates the full capability expected from an analytical operations professional."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"h","text":"Highest Priority"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operations Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Business Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Operations Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Process Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Business Intelligence Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Also Useful"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supply Chain Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Logistics Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Data Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Operations Management Intern"},{"text":"Sales Operations Intern"},{"text":"Customer Operations Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The best internship involves real operational data, KPI reporting, process analysis, and improvement recommendations."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Operations Executive"},{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Process Analyst"},{"text":"Business Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Operations Data Analyst"},{"text":"Reporting Analyst"},{"text":"Business Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analyst"},{"text":"Logistics Analyst"},{"text":"Workforce Analyst"},{"text":"Sales Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Customer Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Process Improvement Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Business Operations Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business KPIs"},{"text":"Process performance"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Management reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Operations Analyst","Senior Operations Analyst","Business Operations Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Supply Chain Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Warehousing"},{"text":"Transportation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Career path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Operations Analyst","Supply Chain Analyst","Senior Analyst","Supply Chain Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Process Excellence"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lean"},{"text":"Six Sigma"},{"text":"Process mapping"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Continuous improvement"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Process Improvement Analyst"},{"text":"Business Process Analyst"},{"text":"Continuous Improvement Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Workforce Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Workforce planning"},{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Staffing"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Attrition"},{"text":"Capacity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Revenue / Sales Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sales pipeline"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Territory performance"},{"text":"Revenue metrics"},{"text":"Sales productivity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Operations Analyst","Sales Operations Analyst","Revenue Operations Analyst","RevOps Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer","Important Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Operations, logistics, inventory, analytics"}],[{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Process improvement, productivity, quality"}],[{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Supply chain, transportation, forecasting"}],[{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Process analytics, SLA, reporting"}],[{"text":"IT Services"},{"text":"Operations, SLA, workforce analytics"}],[{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"Business operations, customer operations"}],[{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"Inventory, sales and store analytics"}],[{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Process, capacity and service analytics"}],[{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Business analysis, process improvement"}],[{"text":"Startups"},{"text":"Cross-functional operations + analytics"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful certifications include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Process Improvement"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lean Six Sigma Yellow Belt"},{"text":"Lean Six Sigma Green Belt"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAPM or equivalent foundational project-management training"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Supply Chain"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supply-chain analytics programs"},{"text":"Procurement/logistics certifications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications should complement real projects and internship experience."}]},{"heading":"PG Study Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is not mandatory for an Operations Analyst."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful options include:"},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operations Management"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"Operations & Supply Chain"},{"text":"Business Strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MSc"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Data Analytics"},{"text":"Operations Research"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Com"},{"type":"p","text":"Can be useful for maintaining a broader commerce/management pathway, although it is generally less specialised for advanced operations analytics than an MBA or analytics master's."},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Automation in Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"AI is increasingly useful for:"},{"type":"h","text":"Forecasting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Demand"},{"text":"Workload"},{"text":"Staffing"},{"text":"Inventory"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Anomaly Detection"},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unusual delays"},{"text":"Cost spikes"},{"text":"Productivity drops"},{"text":"Process errors"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Process Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"Automate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reports"},{"text":"Data extraction"},{"text":"Reconciliation"},{"text":"Alerts"},{"text":"KPI updates"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Generative AI"},{"type":"p","text":"Can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operational summaries"},{"text":"Root-cause hypotheses"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Process analysis"},{"text":"Management reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI-generated recommendations should still be validated against operational data and business constraints."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong traditional pathway:"},{"type":"h","text":"BBA Business Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Operations Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Operations Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Operations Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Operations Manager / Business Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Operations Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Operations Strategy Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Business Operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative Analytics Path"},{"type":"h","text":"Operations Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analyst / BI Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Data/BI Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong route for students who prefer data and technology over people management."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"flow","items":["Operations Management","Business Strategy","Finance","Supply Chain Fundamentals"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Statistics","SQL","Excel","Power BI","Data Modelling"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Process"},{"type":"flow","items":["Process Mapping","Root-Cause Analysis","Lean","Six Sigma"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Forecasting","Optimisation","Python","Automation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem Solving","Communication","Presentation","Stakeholder Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary Objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business + statistics + Excel"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Operations + SQL + Power BI"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Process analysis + KPI dashboards + internship"}],[{"text":"Final Year"},{"text":"Forecasting + automation + advanced projects"}],[{"text":"0–2 Years"},{"text":"Operations Analyst / Business Analyst"}],[{"text":"2–5 Years"},{"text":"Senior Operations Analyst / Process Analyst"}],[{"text":"5–10 Years"},{"text":"Operations Manager / Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"10+ Years"},{"text":"Operations Strategy Head / Business Operations Head"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For this degree-to-career combination, the strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Business Analytics","Operations Analytics Internship","Operations Analyst","Senior Operations/Business Analyst","Operations or Analytics Manager","Operations Leadership"]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should avoid becoming limited to routine MIS reporting. A stronger Operations Analyst combines business understanding + operational process knowledge + SQL + Excel + Power BI + statistics + root-cause analysis + process improvement. Adding forecasting, Python, automation, Lean/Six Sigma, and AI-assisted analytics creates a pathway from entry-level operational reporting into business analytics, process excellence, supply-chain analytics, revenue operations, and strategic operations management."}]}]}